WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.240
Bueno, lo hacemos realidad.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.320
No.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.400
What did you just do?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:13.840
What?

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.120
I'm trying to help you.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.640
You know that

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.160
I can't have children.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.840
What am I supposed

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.000
to do at that exam?

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.200
Oh my gosh, Gina.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.160
What happened to you?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.040
Where's the shiny flower

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.600
who stole my heart?

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.200
You used to believe in miracles.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.880
But if it turns out that

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.160
you're not pregnant, just...

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.120
just tell him the truth.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.360
Truth

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.080
always works.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.520
Right?

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.880
By the way,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.400
is Walt having you see

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.840
Dr. Ramirez by any chance?

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.040
Yeah.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.040
I guess.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.320
Nothing.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.960
Nothing compares to you.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.200
Humbert.
